 - The text-then-dialog questions are the step 2 glob question, the step 3 template choice with at most three candidates, the step 6 approval question, the step 8 process offer and the step 9 destination question. Every other question about a draft or a list, and every free-text question, is plain text only: the step 3 template choice with more than three candidates, the step 5 question rounds, the step 9 required headings, guidance and another-folder name.
